e acting by Kiba Walker (Camp Buddy, Full Service, Mister Versatile, Morningdew Farms, and To Trust an Incubus)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237040/extras/0d607d668ae8005014f23a13b991245a.avif?t=1738203804\" /></div><br>Partial voice acting by Sean Chiplock (Full Service, To Trust an Incubus, Spiderman: Miles Morales, The Last of Us II) <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237040/extras/f5d4d68e388d9d684f7bd6a0af8c6559.avif?t=1738203804\" /></div><br>Partial voice acting by Khristopher Padua<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237040/extras/79d9bab1cf5e4dd7329b9e1ff87e9b33.avif?t=1738203804\" /></div><br>Patial voice acting by Sean Chiplock (Mornindew Farms, Mister Versatile, One Punch Man, Persona 5, Demon Slayer)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237040/extras/41be6310030faa34310e6b29ce41f00b.avif?t=1738203804\" /></div><br>Partial voice acting by Nathan Matthews (To Trust an Incubus, The Yaoikuza)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237040/extras/4496120400a4cd1b83a50cde1b7157f4.avif?t=1738203804\" /></div><br>Partial voice acting by Bryce Chadwell (Morningdew Farms)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237040/extras/5a0b4bc9cfe8eae38753e17b258b5c08.avif?t=1738203804\" /></div><br>Partial voice acting by L. Alphonso<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237040/extras/07511680c43b380dac2a49b3bc6c5985.avif?t=1738203804\"